Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.16,Short,,0,0,0,,That wet dog shake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:02.46,Short,,0,0,0,,is a feat of physics
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:03.78,Short,,0,0,0,,A soaked Labrador
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:04.42,Short,,0,0,0,,can carry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.50,Short,,0,0,0,,about a pound of water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:06.42,Short,,0,0,0,,in its fur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:07.34,Short,,0,0,0,,Drying that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:08.20,Short,,0,0,0,,with body heat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:08.74,Short,,0,0,0,,would burn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:09.38,Short,,0,0,0,,about a fifth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.85,Short,,0,0,0,,of its daily food
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:11.54,Short,,0,0,0,,So instead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:12.38,Short,,0,0,0,,it shakes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:13.26,Short,,0,0,0,,It twists
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:14.12,Short,,0,0,0,,back and forth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:15.22,Short,,0,0,0,,about four times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:15.70,Short,,0,0,0,,a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:16.66,Short,,0,0,0,,starting at the head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.46,Short,,0,0,0,,and rippling down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:18.26,Short,,0,0,0,,to the tail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:19.40,Short,,0,0,0,,Its loose skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.10,Short,,0,0,0,,whips around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:20.90,Short,,0,0,0,,even further
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:22.08,Short,,0,0,0,,flinging the water off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.84,Short,,0,0,0,,faster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.58,Short,,0,0,0,,In about four seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.10,Short,,0,0,0,,seventy percent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:25.78,Short,,0,0,0,,of the water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:26.71,Short,,0,0,0,,is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:27.62,Short,,0,0,0,,Smaller animals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:28.88,Short,,0,0,0,,have to shake faster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:29.76,Short,,0,0,0,,A mouse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:30.23,Short,,0,0,0,,does it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:30.94,Short,,0,0,0,,thirty times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:31.80,Short,,0,0,0,,a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:32.56,Short,,0,0,0,,So when your dog
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.18,Short,,0,0,0,,climbs out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:33.84,Short,,0,0,0,,of the bath
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.66,Short,,0,0,0,,grab a towel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:35.03,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.71,0:00:31.55,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho's been soaked by a wet dog
